  "current_evidence": [
    "T01 Root acceptance causally locates original legacy-versus-custody class mismatch before real expiry. It explicitly supplies no seven-read successor qualification.",
    "T05 successor v2 helper already exists; current e436f2 helper adds current_legacy_context_sessions to exact custody/legacy origin selection. AST comparison against retained3378 preimage proves only selected changed; require/read_scope/generate remain identical.",
    "Current API wrapper selects that v2 helper. Current-legacy MachineContextSessions.view_get delegates through it, using the actual parent owner channel for policy custody and the actual Machine Actor for generation. No production correction is evidenced as still missing by this static review.",
    "Existing MachineTransport class contains all14 tests, including one seven-operation case and original signature, nonce, Actor spoof, effect refusal, restoration, revocation, termination, borrower-close, real-expiry and closed-proof-shape cases. Parent Sessions supplies real fresh per-method owned fixture resources.",
    "Accepted execution-state still marks T05 in-progress with only staging receipts. No recorded successor seven-read/complete14 result is supplied there. The accepted T06 startup34 catalog result had zero dispatched operations and does not close T05."
  ],
